  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>上周你们交的问题单，有三张问的不是“内容是什么”。</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 14 }}>「为什么他说话这么绕？」</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 14, marginTop: 10 }}>「第一句就下判断，凭什么？」</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 14, marginTop: 10 }}>「土气到底是什么意思？」</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#B4552D', marginTop: 22 }}>这些问得对。今天接着问。</Text>
